# Hyprland global shortcuts the Neko shell registers, one per line: a menu
# route to toggle, a panel plugin to toggle, a volume or brightness key, or an
# argument-free IPC call as target.method. A binding written as o.bind(keys,
# description, { menu = "theme" }), { panel = "neko.emojis" },
# { audio = "raise" }, { brightness = "raise" } or { ipc = "media.next" }
# dispatches the matching shortcut straight to the shell, with no process to
# spawn per keypress. Anything missing here still binds, through the
# neko-menu, neko-shell, neko-audio-output-volume or
# neko-brightness-display command instead.
menu root
menu apps
menu capture
menu toggle
menu hardware
menu system
menu background
menu theme
menu share
panel neko.clipboard
panel neko.emojis
panel neko.audio
panel neko.bluetooth
panel neko.monitor
panel neko.clock
panel neko.elsewhen
panel neko.network
panel neko.power
audio raise
audio lower
audio mute-toggle
brightness raise
brightness lower
ipc media.playPause
ipc media.next
ipc media.previous
ipc notifications.dismissOne
ipc notifications.dismissAll
ipc notifications.invokeLast
ipc notifications.showHistory
